    <string name="SvipeApkBlocked">Bu fayl ma\'lum virus. Svipe uni aniqladi va bloklab qo\'ydi — bu yerdan ochib ham, o\'rnatib ham bo\'lmaydi.</string>
    <string name="SvipeApkBlockedTitle">Virus bloklandi</string>
    <string name="SvipeApkBlockedDetail">Aynan shu fayl zararli dastur sifatida ro\'yxatga olingan. Yuborgan odam buni bilmasligi mumkin — uning telefoni zararlangan bo\'lib, faylni o\'zi tarqatayotgan bo\'lishi mumkin.</string>
